# THE TRUNK'S ROOT RULES, NARROWED BACK FOR THIS MODULE. The branch now carries
# the repository's own .gitignore, which keeps stray recordings out with *.wav and
# downloaded weights out with models/. Both are right for the trunk and wrong
# inside here, and a rule deeper in the tree is the one that wins:
#
#   *.wav    the takes and the samples ARE the reference material of the tooling -
#            53 of them are versioned on purpose, and .gitattributes sends every
#            one through LFS. The weights themselves are excluded by name in
#            model-whisper-ru/weights/.gitignore, so nothing heavy rides in here.
#   models/  here this is not a folder of weights but source: the adapter's
#            src/models/, and the descriptors by which a new model mod is added.
#
# Without these two lines `git add .` skips a new take or a new descriptor and
# says nothing, which is how a recording that exists nowhere else gets lost.
!*.wav
!models/
